	(text_box "All 10uF capactors are electrolytics\nAll 100nF capacitors are ceramics\nJetson power supply is external\nWall outlet\n    ↓\n5V 5A single adapter (barrel jack input)\n    ↓\nYour PCB main switch + fuse\n    |-- AMS1117 → 3.3V → ESP32 board (fused at 500mA)\n    |-- Direct 5V → Jetson Nano connector (fused at 3A)\n         ↓\n    Jetson Nano via cable\nEnclosure: Custom 3D printed PETG\n           Vented design with 40mm intake fan\n           Houses ESP32 PCB + Jetson Nano devkit"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 170.18 114.3 0)
		(size 109.22 46.99)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
